{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1859279395"}, "name":{"label":"Download bloop"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-16T07:21:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.79"}, "id":{"label":"13640230190"}, "title":{"label":"Must download, Great game"}, "content":{"label":"It is just a phenomenal air to air combat mobile game. Everything is great and all but some things that could be better are the crash physics, how the plane gets damaged like the planes just have health like at 1 hp my plane functions great it should be like the missiles or bullets damage a specific part of the plane instead of taking the hp like the wing broke off, the elevator broke off like that is what could make it really great game and instead of infrared missile or heat-seaking missiles it should be like AIM-9 missile or R-73 missile or the phoenix missile that is on the F-14 Tomcat. But overall a great game, would recommend.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1879290585"}, "name":{"label":"Hamzah.147"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-14T07:49:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.79"}, "id":{"label":"13632856571"}, "title":{"label":"Game not working"}, "content":{"label":"The game is hung at the home screen since morning and is displaying “Downloading content manifest” . I reinstalled the game but the issue persists.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1878043614"}, "name":{"label":"ThatHumbleReviewer"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-11T01:39:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.78"}, "id":{"label":"13620446696"}, "title":{"label":"Good Air Combat, Needs More Gameplay Depth"}, "content":{"label":"Metalstorm is a good game for players who enjoy air-to-air combat. Matches are short, action-packed, and easy to play, making it perfect for quick sessions. Overall quality and gameplay mechanics are good.\n\nTo make it even better, the game could include ground or naval take-offs, landings, and mission-based modes like base attacks or special operations. Longer matches would also help deepen the experience.\n\nWith hope for future updates.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1477798483"}, "name":{"label":"Bangudya"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-05T08:14:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.78"}, "id":{"label":"13598173500"}, "title":{"label":"Best game with few observation"}, "content":{"label":"Game is good along with its graphics and design \n\nFew are my observation, if implemented will increase it’s rating \n\n1. Provide mission scenario with targets and dogfight\n2. Selection of missiles as per real aircraft.\n3. All best airport include tejas and su30mki.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1750602251"}, "name":{"label":"!n17"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-24T18:16:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.78"}, "id":{"label":"13551760031"}, "title":{"label":"Great Game, Missing First-Person Immersion"}, "content":{"label":"The game is very well designed with smooth controls, good graphics, and an overall enjoyable gameplay experience. Everything feels polished and engaging. The only thing missing is a first-person cockpit (FPP) perspective. If an FPP cockpit view were added, the game would feel much more realistic and immersive", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
